WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.230
- All right, before we go,

00:00:01.230 --> 00:00:04.830
I have one last awesome gem I
found, scrolling social media.

00:00:04.830 --> 00:00:05.760
You're welcome in advance.

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:06.776
This is What I'm Liking.

00:00:06.776 --> 00:00:09.420
(bold music)
(audience cheering)

00:00:09.420 --> 00:00:12.030
As mamas, our jobs are to raise our kids

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:13.950
to do the right thing,
what we feel is right.

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:16.020
So when one Virginia Beach mama found out

00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:18.180
her 16-year-old son tipped a server less

00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:20.670
than 10%, she told him what was up.

00:00:20.670 --> 00:00:22.410
Check this out.

00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:25.890
- [Danielle] Johnny, you
need to go get my wallet.

00:00:25.890 --> 00:00:28.350
You need to go get my Visa card.

00:00:28.350 --> 00:00:30.690
You need to go to the ATM and you need

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:33.630
to go grab a 20 and drive your (beep) back

00:00:33.630 --> 00:00:34.830
to that restaurant,

00:00:34.830 --> 00:00:38.703
because on a $104 check,
$10 is a (beep) tip.

00:00:39.660 --> 00:00:41.220
Do you understand me?

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:45.890
Go grab my credit card, get
$20 and drive it back there.

00:00:45.890 --> 00:00:46.797
Yes ma'am.

00:00:46.797 --> 00:00:47.811
- [Johnny] Yes ma'am.

00:00:47.811 --> 00:00:48.973
(audience cheering and applauding)

00:00:48.973 --> 00:00:51.240
- She said, "Yes ma'am."

00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:52.710
We have that mama, Danielle

00:00:52.710 --> 00:00:55.140
on the line right now,
along with her son, Johnny.

00:00:55.140 --> 00:00:56.685
I'm so sorry, Johnny (laughs).

00:00:56.685 --> 00:00:58.851
(audience applauding)

00:00:58.851 --> 00:01:00.840
So, Danielle.

00:01:00.840 --> 00:01:01.673
- Hi, how are you?

00:01:01.673 --> 00:01:03.090
- You seem pretty worked up in the video.

00:01:03.090 --> 00:01:04.590
You sound like you were maybe, a server.

00:01:04.590 --> 00:01:06.480
I was a server, were you?

00:01:06.480 --> 00:01:09.045
- Yes, I was a server (chuckles).

00:01:09.045 --> 00:01:10.620
- So you get it, you get it, man.

00:01:10.620 --> 00:01:11.715
You survive off those tips.

00:01:11.715 --> 00:01:15.870
So do you usually go off
on him for not tipping?

00:01:15.870 --> 00:01:17.280
This is amazing.

00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:19.527
- Yes, I usually go off on him (laughs).

00:01:21.300 --> 00:01:23.790
We have that relationship,
I guess (laughs).

00:01:23.790 --> 00:01:24.630
- No, I love it.

00:01:24.630 --> 00:01:25.463
It's honest

00:01:25.463 --> 00:01:27.900
and also, it's teaching him
what is the norm, right?

00:01:27.900 --> 00:01:32.100
So Johnny, were you surprised
by your mom's reaction?

00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:32.970
- In the beginning, yeah.

00:01:32.970 --> 00:01:35.544
But, she's from Jersey,
so she's kinda like that.

00:01:35.544 --> 00:01:36.960
(audience laughing)

00:01:36.960 --> 00:01:38.940
I learned my lesson now.

00:01:38.940 --> 00:01:39.773
- Yes you did.

00:01:39.773 --> 00:01:42.630
- He is definitely gonna
do that 10%, Danielle.

00:01:42.630 --> 00:01:43.680
Oh, my gosh, well, I love it.

00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:44.790
I think it's so important too

00:01:44.790 --> 00:01:46.230
because if you have been a server,

00:01:46.230 --> 00:01:49.020
you realize those tips really do count.

00:01:49.020 --> 00:01:50.550
So thank you for going back, Johnny.

00:01:50.550 --> 00:01:53.190
That was very cool to
do to for the server.

00:01:53.190 --> 00:01:55.440
And thank you, Danielle,
for teaching your boy how

00:01:55.440 --> 00:01:56.310
to do it right.

00:01:56.310 --> 00:01:57.869
I'm liking your post right now, all right?

00:01:57.869 --> 00:02:00.482
(audience applauding)

00:02:00.482 --> 00:02:01.770
- [Danielle] All right, thank you.

00:02:01.770 --> 00:02:02.760
- All right, but that's not all.

00:02:02.760 --> 00:02:05.130
Our season-long partner,
Pilot Pen, makers of G2,

00:02:05.130 --> 00:02:07.053
the go-to pen of the
Kelly Clarkson Show, love

00:02:07.053 --> 00:02:08.430
that you're looking out for people

00:02:08.430 --> 00:02:09.390
in the service industry.

00:02:09.390 --> 00:02:12.210
So they're gonna be writing
you a check for $1,000.

00:02:12.210 --> 00:02:14.925
How's that sound?
(audience cheering)

00:02:14.925 --> 00:02:16.620
(Kelly chuckling)

00:02:16.620 --> 00:02:20.520
Thank you guys so much,
you are a funny family.

00:02:20.520 --> 00:02:21.900
Thank you to all our guests this hour,

00:02:21.900 --> 00:02:25.020
Ben Affleck, Mat Damon,
Chris Tucker, Skylar Vann,

00:02:25.020 --> 00:02:27.300
the whole Oklahoma Women's Basketball Team

00:02:27.300 --> 00:02:28.950
and Lawrence Zarian,
y'all have a great day.

00:02:28.950 --> 00:02:31.200
If it's not, try and change it.

